{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Live Your Rise: From Amateur to Legend</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let every blow life deals you become a weapon you'll use in the ring. In <strong>Rising Spirit</strong>, it's not just your fists, but your decisions that matter. Starting as an amateur, you will fight to make a name for yourself and earn a luxurious life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126830/extras/2f4ec9b909a7389398e2b5fd5aae0bd5.poster.avif?t=1774882154\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126830/extras/2f4ec9b909a7389398e2b5fd5aae0bd5.webm?t=1774882154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126830/extras/2f4ec9b909a7389398e2b5fd5aae0bd5.mp4?t=1774882154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">&quot;Everyone has a plan until they get punched in the mouth.&quot; - <strong>Mike Tyson</strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The Streets Call: Survival Simulation </strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first step on the road to the World Championship is keeping yourself fed. You need money for training, nutrition, and manager fees.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Daytime Hustle:</strong> The weight of the delivery package is no different from your gym bag. In the beginning, work as a delivery person to make ends meet. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126830/extras/8a1f1565b97ed135ba0d29942a0761aa.poster.avif?t=1774882154\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126830/extras/8a1f1565b97ed135ba0d29942a0761aa.webm?t=1774882154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126830/extras/8a1f1565b97ed135ba0d29942a0761aa.mp4?t=1774882154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Dark of Night:</strong> Want faster money and bigger risks? Participate in the underground world's illegal fights. There's only one goal: Cash and survival.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126830/extras/b3c0e86c53bce3bc5d5f43f106b65163.poster.avif?t=1774882154\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126830/extras/b3c0e86c53bce3bc5d5f43f106b65163.webm?t=1774882154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126830/extras/b3c0e86c53bce3bc5d5f43f106b65163.mp4?t=1774882154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Maintain the Balance: Training and Nutrition</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success isn't only won in the ring. The gym is your second home.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running, weights, and the punching bag. Every session will increase your stamina, strength, and speed. But be careful, overtraining can lead to injuries.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126830/extras/cc7feab106ccc6c7418bbd780ec26b9e.poster.avif?t=1774882154\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126830/extras/cc7feab106ccc6c7418bbd780ec26b9e.webm?t=1774882154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126830/extras/cc7feab106ccc6c7418bbd780ec26b9e.mp4?t=1774882154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Climb to the Top: The Ranking System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every fight you win will move you up the ladder and allow you to earn more money. Only the best can be a <strong>WORLD CHAMPION</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126830/extras/f2dfde0a0274b22798a1e40b30069320.poster.avif?t=1774882154\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126830/extras/f2dfde0a0274b22798a1e40b30069320.webm?t=1774882154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126830/extras/f2dfde0a0274b22798a1e40b30069320.mp4?t=1774882154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4126830?t=1774882154","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126830/44a73188316419fd1f90bd0c4806dc1bc95abb2b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774882154","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126830/dd40daf35ff59da08c9764ce1c65a8565ed4c428/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774882154","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126830/dd40daf35ff59da08c9764ce1c65a8565ed4c428/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774882154","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"